VizieR catalogues, CDS, Strasbourg (DOI 10.26093/cds/vizier). Their use follows the VizieR terms at https://cds.unistra.fr/vizier-org/licences_vizier.html, which allow free scientific and non-commercial use with citation of the original authors:
