  VII/9    Lynds B.T. 1965, ApJS 12, 163
  VII/7A   Lynds B.T. 1962, ApJS 7, 1
  VII/220A Barnard E.E. 1927, Carnegie Institution of Washington
  VII/21   van den Bergh S. 1966, AJ 71, 990
  VII/192  Arp H. 1966, ApJS 14, 1; Webb 1996
  VII/213  Hickson P. 1982, ApJ 255, 382
  VII/297  Green D.A. 2025, A Catalogue of Galactic Supernova Remnants
  V/84     Acker A. et al. 1992, Strasbourg-ESO Catalogue of Galactic Planetary Nebulae
  VII/216  Rodgers A.W., Campbell C.T., Whiteoak J.B. 1960, MNRAS 121, 103
